00:05:10,588 --> 00:05:16,588
When real life sucks, REEL life rules!

2
00:10:21,176 --> 00:10:27,176
The 4:30 Movie is a comedy, romance film directed by Kevin Smith.

3
00:15:31,764 --> 00:15:37,764
In the summer of 1986, three sixteen year old friends spend their
Saturdays sneaking into movies at the local multiplex.

4
00:20:42,352 --> 00:20:48,352
But when one of the guys also invites the girl of his dreams to see the
latest comedy, each of the teens learn more about life and love.

5
00:25:52,941 --> 00:25:58,941
Melody Barnegat, played by Siena Agudong.

6
00:31:03,529 --> 00:31:09,529
Brian David, played by Austin Zajur.

7
00:36:14,117 --> 00:36:20,117
Burny, played by Nicholas Cirillo.

8
00:41:24,705 --> 00:41:30,705
Belly, played by Reed Northrup.

9
00:46:35,294 --> 00:46:41,294
Manager Mike, played by Ken Jeong.

10
00:51:45,882 --> 00:51:51,882
Major Murder, played by Sam Richardson.

11
00:56:56,470 --> 00:57:02,470
The 4:30 Movie is a 2024 American semi-autobiographical
coming-of-age comedy film written and directed by Kevin Smith.

12
01:02:07,058 --> 01:02:13,058
It stars Austin Zajur, Nicholas Cirillo, Reed
Northrup, Siena Agudong, and Ken Jeong.

13
01:07:17,647 --> 01:07:23,647
The story is loosely based on Smith's experiences sneaking into movie
theaters as a teenager and his earliest romantic endeavors.

14
01:12:28,235 --> 01:12:34,235
It was released on September 13, 2024, by Saban Films.

15
01:17:38,823 --> 01:17:44,823
The film explores themes of coming of age, teenage
crush, semi autobiographical, movie theater.

16
01:22:49,411 --> 01:22:55,411
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
